@startuml
actor fan: Fan
participant web: TripWebsite
box "Order Processing Center"
participant po: PurchaseOrderService
participant cancellations: CancellationTask
participant order: TripOrder
participant gateway[i]: SupplierGateway
end box
box "Other organizations" <<external>>
participant bank: Bank
participant supplier[i]: SupplierProvider
end box
fan -> web: cancel(orderId)
activate web
web -> po: cancel(orderId)
activate po
po -> cancellations: cancel(orderId)
activate cancellations
cancellations -> bank: refund(captureId, amount)
activate bank
bank --> cancellations: refundId
deactivate bank
cancellations -> order: mark_cancelling()
note right of cancellations
cancel() refunds the payment, then marks
the trip order and each placed or confirmed
supplier order cancelling
(services/opc/cancellation_task.py:39,
services/opc/cancellation_task.py:44).
end note
cancellations --> po
deactivate cancellations
po --> web: cancelling
deactivate po
web --> fan: Your trip is being cancelled
deactivate web
o-> cancellations: cancel_supplier_orders()
activate cancellations
note right of cancellations
The scheduler runs this job every 60 s
(services/opc/cancellation_task.py:12,
services/opc/service.py:60).
end note
loop [for each supplier order marked cancelling]
cancellations -> gateway[i]: cancel(supplierOrder)
activate gateway[i]
alt [the gateway cancels through the supplier's API]
gateway[i] -> supplier[i]: cancel(reference)
activate supplier[i]
supplier[i] --> gateway[i]: cancelled
deactivate supplier[i]
gateway[i] --> cancellations
else [the gateway raises an exception]
gateway[i] --> cancellations: exception
end
deactivate gateway[i]
end
note right of cancellations
After an exception, the supplier order stays
cancelling and the next run tries it again
(services/opc/cancellation_task.py:52,
services/opc/cancellation_task.py:54).
Otherwise it is marked cancelled
(services/opc/cancellation_task.py:57).
GlampingCoGateway.cancel raises
ManualCancellationRequired when check-in is
72 hours away or less
(services/opc/partners/glamping_co.py:9,
services/opc/partners/glamping_co.py:17).
end note
opt [every supplier order cancelled or rejected]
cancellations -> order: mark_cancelled()
end
deactivate cancellations
note right of fan
Key: UML 2.5.1 sequence diagram.
Filled arrowhead: synchronous call.
Dashed arrow: reply.
Arrow from a dot: a call from outside
the diagram (the scheduler).
end note
@enduml
